// `e When c` is `e` where `c` holds and nothing otherwise; `When` has the lowest precedence (D14).
Fact x Identified by Int
Fact y Identified by 1..10 Holds when x(y).
+x(5).
?y(5).
Fact p Identified by P
Event e Terminates p When 1 + 1 == 2.
+p(P).
e().
?!p(P).
?(Count(Foreach y: y When y > 100) == 0).
